/-!
# A061199

Upper right triangle read by columns where T(n,k), with k >= n, is the number of partitions of k where no part appears more than n times; also partitions of k where no parts are multiples of (n+1).

The 81 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A061199

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `0`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 2, 0, 2, 2, 3,
    0, 2, 4, 4, 5, 0, 3, 5, 6, 6,
    7, 0, 4, 7, 9, 10, 10, 11, 0, 5,
